# MathQuest Academy

MathQuest Academy is a Duolingo/Brilliant-style learning prototype with:

- Courses for Math, Greek, Astrophysics, and Coding
- Sections, units, and lessons generated across each course
- MP, short for Math Points
- Streaks, leaderboard, games, ads for free users, and premium mode
- Local email/password accounts so progress is saved in the browser
- Stripe Payment Link setup for a future paid premium checkout

